Z||000002||ChadMan||12-02-1999||09:54 AM||||The Brooklands book is fantastic - but it's not comprehensive.  There were quite a few road tests of Fieros by major mags that weren't included (like a 6-way Road & Track test among a Fiero GT, an MR2, a CRX, an Alfa Spider, a Morgan +4, and another sports car I can't remember right now).  It also doesn't include any Motor Trend tests at all.||||reg||14
